      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَوَّمْتُ الخُبْزَ</span></b>  <i>I made bread,</i> or <i>the bread.</i>
(IJ, M.) [And] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَوِّمُوا لَنَا</span> <i>Make ye bread for us:</i>
(T, S:) a phrase said by Fr to have been heard
from the Arabs as meaning thus. (T.)

